WEBVTT

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
kikoeru ka kikoeru darou

00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.530
<i>Can you hear it? I'm sure you can...</i>

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
harukana todoroki

00:00:10.530 --> 00:00:14.360
<i>...that faraway roar!</i>

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
yami no naka kokoro yusaburu

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.530
<i>Your soul trembles in the darkness</i>

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
mezame hajimaru

00:00:19.530 --> 00:00:22.700
<i>as it begins to awaken</i>

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
daichi wari sosoritatsu sugata

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:25.750
<i>A towering figure shatters the earth</i>

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
seigi no akashi ka

00:00:25.830 --> 00:00:28.920
<i>Is it the symbol of justice?</i>

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
densetsu no kyojin no chikara

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:33.010
<i>The legendary giant's power</i>

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
ginga kirisaku

00:00:33.220 --> 00:00:35.970
<i>will tear through the galaxy!</i>

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
otakebi ga denkou sekka no

00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:39.220
<i>Our war cry will summon</i>

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
ichigeki wo yobu

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.060
<i>a flash of lightning!</i>

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
furueru na hitomi korase yo

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:45.100
<i>Have no fear, focus your eyes on...</i>

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
fukkatsu no toki

00:00:45.190 --> 00:00:50.480
<i>the moment of resurrection!</i>

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
hito yo inochi yo hajimari wo miru

00:00:52.030 --> 00:00:57.240
<i>Mankind and all life witness it begin</i>

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:03.160
<i>Space Runaway ldeon, Ideon</i>

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:10.170
<i>Space Runaway Ideon, Ideon</i>

00:01:24.220 --> 00:01:25.730
Cosmo!

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:25.730
Be quiet!

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:30.440
The colonists from Earth who had settled on...

00:01:30.440 --> 00:01:33.820
the planet Solo at Point A7
of the Andromeda Galaxy...

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:37.570
have made contact with aliens
known as the Buff Clan.

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.360
Furthermore,

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:44.580
they witnessed a mysterious machine excavated
at Solo transform into the form of a giant.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:47.160
The Earthlings and the Buff Clan,

00:01:47.160 --> 00:01:49.280
were just holding their breath in
anticipation of what was to come.

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:59.800
<b>New Lopia In Flames</b>

00:02:08.690 --> 00:02:09.940
That power...

00:02:10.400 --> 00:02:12.190
It might be the Legendary Giant!

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:13.070
That power!

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:13.730
Mayaya...

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:18.880
The legendary giant would
shine more radiantly...

00:02:21.660 --> 00:02:22.950
What happened?

00:02:23.370 --> 00:02:25.080
It seems that the machines are connected now...

00:02:25.450 --> 00:02:26.950
Deck, take a look outside.

00:02:26.950 --> 00:02:27.400
Okay.

00:02:44.760 --> 00:02:45.890
Cosmo!

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:47.020
The ground!

00:02:47.020 --> 00:02:49.680
The ground is gone!

00:02:47.850 --> 00:02:49.680
What're you clamoring about?

00:02:49.680 --> 00:02:51.560
Can't you just drop down?

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:53.060
Cosmo!

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:54.900
Damn it!

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:01.030
Damn!

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:06.330
Rapapa!

00:03:06.330 --> 00:03:07.990
That tickles!

00:03:07.990 --> 00:03:08.870
Shit!

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:11.460
What the?

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:29.560
That mark's vanishing...

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:30.810
What's happening?

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:32.690
Ms. Sheryl?

00:03:32.690 --> 00:03:34.190
I already told you, I don't know!

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.230
I'm still investigating...

00:03:35.230 --> 00:03:37.520
Investigating, investigating,
always investigating, huh?

00:03:41.650 --> 00:03:44.000
This system's starting up again!

00:03:46.200 --> 00:03:47.160
Look at that robot!

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.740
It's breaking up.

00:03:48.740 --> 00:03:51.480
Is it moving with the sub-control
system we installed?

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.380
At this rate, we'll crash!

00:04:00.920 --> 00:04:02.540
I have to use the retro-rockets!

00:04:11.140 --> 00:04:11.850
Again?

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:13.980
This machine is starting to transform.

00:04:34.620 --> 00:04:35.080
Hey.

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:36.710
Have you gotten in touch with the military yet?

00:04:36.710 --> 00:04:38.920
No, there's a lot of radio interference.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.880
Ms. Sheryl, what's your field of expertise?

00:04:42.130 --> 00:04:43.010
Linguistics.

00:04:44.220 --> 00:04:45.260
Call the engineers in.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:46.680
Have them check this machine.

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.260
You'll offer us the needed data, right?

00:04:49.800 --> 00:04:51.060
It's not like I have a choice.

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:54.760
Well, we're forced to fight against
some incomprehensible enemy here.

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:04.530
Where are the ground forces?

00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:05.820
They're coming.

00:05:05.820 --> 00:05:07.110
What the hell happened?

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:09.120
Didn't you see it on the radar?!

00:05:09.120 --> 00:05:11.410
Enemies that could be aliens
came and attacked us.

00:05:11.410 --> 00:05:12.740
Stop joking.

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:13.950
It's true.

00:05:13.950 --> 00:05:15.040
There's wreckage of the enemy craft here.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.080
Check it and you'll see.

00:05:16.080 --> 00:05:17.640
I'm going to go and check on the other machines.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:21.250
Aliens?

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.710
Well, there was really strong
radio interference...

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:25.260
Don't move away from there.

00:05:25.260 --> 00:05:26.090
Understood.

00:05:27.550 --> 00:05:29.140
Damned annoying monkeys!

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:39.600
Who're you?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.610
I've never seen you before...

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.690
Did you arrive today with the third immigration ship?

00:05:48.660 --> 00:05:50.780
Is that the current fashion
back on Earth nowadays?

00:05:51.950 --> 00:05:53.700
There was some trouble just now.

00:05:54.200 --> 00:05:55.410
lt'd be best if you stay away from here.

00:05:56.660 --> 00:05:59.420
My name is Jordan Bes, a military cadet.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:00.960
What's your name?

00:06:01.750 --> 00:06:02.420
Tell me.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:03.920
"Name?"

00:06:04.300 --> 00:06:06.020
Yes. You can tell me, right?

00:06:07.170 --> 00:06:09.340
Karala Ajiba. "Nice man."

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:12.010
Why, thank you.

00:06:12.930 --> 00:06:15.640
Although I'm happy to hear
 that from a beauty like you,

00:06:15.640 --> 00:06:17.390
I can't go out on a date with you right now.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:20.520
If you head straight from here, you'll find
the shortest route to New Lopia.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:22.270
It's dangerous here, so you'd better go back.

00:06:27.570 --> 00:06:29.900
Could you at least thank me in return?

00:06:30.280 --> 00:06:31.320
Let's go out on a date tomorrow.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.080
Thank you, Bes.

00:06:35.450 --> 00:06:36.330
See you tomorrow!

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:39.250
Damn it, if it weren't for this...

00:06:43.540 --> 00:06:46.090
Damned Mayaya, you left me behind.

00:06:54.930 --> 00:06:57.560
Logo Dau's the last planet in this area.

00:06:57.560 --> 00:07:00.350
The planet where we think the Ide exists.

00:07:00.940 --> 00:07:04.020
Therefore I can understand Lady
Karala's impatience quite well.

00:07:04.020 --> 00:07:07.400
Nevertheless, we've never had 
contact with aliens before.

00:07:07.400 --> 00:07:08.070
Yeah...

00:07:08.530 --> 00:07:13.030
You're soft on her because you served under
 her father, Supreme Commander Doba.

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:18.660
What if the military strength of the
aliens on Logo Dau surpasses ours?

00:07:19.950 --> 00:07:21.370
That's not possible.

00:07:20.540 --> 00:07:21.370
Commander Gije!

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:26.380
The number of aliens on Logo Dau
seems to be extremely small.

00:07:26.670 --> 00:07:29.090
An enormous spaceship has been spotted,

00:07:29.090 --> 00:07:31.280
but we believe that the planet
 has been colonized only recently.

00:07:32.340 --> 00:07:33.510
A colony planet, huh?

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:34.820
How about their military strength?

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:37.720
We only have data from
the automatic cameras,

00:07:37.720 --> 00:07:38.720
but it seems close to none.

00:07:38.720 --> 00:07:39.350
What!?

00:07:39.350 --> 00:07:40.680
I'm going to sortie.

00:07:41.060 --> 00:07:43.900
At the very least, I have to
 confirm Lady Karala's safety.

00:07:43.900 --> 00:07:45.110
All right.

00:07:45.110 --> 00:07:48.070
It'll help you save face with Lord Doba.

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:49.360
Damido!

00:07:49.650 --> 00:07:52.990
I'm not helping her just
 for my personal benefit!

00:07:52.990 --> 00:07:53.660
Yeah.

00:07:54.200 --> 00:07:57.950
If anything were to happen to Lady Karala,
I would face the consequences as well.

00:07:57.950 --> 00:07:59.160
That's right.

00:07:59.450 --> 00:08:00.250
Cosmo!

00:08:00.250 --> 00:08:01.870
It turned into a vehicle this time!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:02.790
Right.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:03.920
Can't we move?

00:08:03.920 --> 00:08:05.500
I'm fixing the wiring now.

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:06.840
Next one is...

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:09.710
You were riding this thing?!

00:08:09.710 --> 00:08:11.300
Cosmo controlled it.

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.220
No way.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.180
It's you again.

00:08:14.590 --> 00:08:16.010
Did you really control it?

00:08:16.010 --> 00:08:17.180
I tried to.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:19.640
This thing's also a relic from
the Sixth Civilization, right?

00:08:19.640 --> 00:08:21.600
Yeah. So Cosmo, you did it?

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:22.560
Yeah.

00:08:22.560 --> 00:08:24.270
But I think it worked really well...

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:25.560
When that thing turned on.

00:08:27.980 --> 00:08:29.070
The Ideon Gauge.

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:30.610
That's what you said, right?

00:08:30.610 --> 00:08:34.490
The symbols resemble Greek letters, but
they're not read the same way...

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:36.030
So then...

00:08:36.030 --> 00:08:38.410
that's its name when it
turns into a giant robot...

00:08:38.410 --> 00:08:39.370
"Ideon".

00:08:39.870 --> 00:08:40.620
Is that right?

00:08:41.120 --> 00:08:44.500
Amongst the words on the relics left
behind by the Sixth Civilization,

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.330
the word Ideon appeared,

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:47.670
but we still don't know it's real meaning.

00:08:47.670 --> 00:08:52.630
What have you linguists been doing
these last six months anyway?

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:53.840
Joliver!

00:08:54.090 --> 00:08:55.050
Take care of the rest.

00:08:55.050 --> 00:08:55.630
Yeah.

00:08:56.130 --> 00:08:58.720
Ms. Sheryl gave me a copy of the blueprints.

00:08:59.260 --> 00:09:00.970
All three vehicles have considerable space inside.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:02.560
Install some weapons on them.

00:09:02.970 --> 00:09:03.890
Damned soldier!

00:09:03.890 --> 00:09:06.270
If it wasn't for our foundational research...

00:09:06.270 --> 00:09:07.580
They wouldn't even be able to do anything.

00:09:11.520 --> 00:09:14.240
Copolas One, Two, and Three,
hurry to the launch area!

00:09:14.940 --> 00:09:16.820
Get the second hatch ready for standby!

00:09:19.320 --> 00:09:21.200
The Dekka Bau squadron will take the lead.

00:09:37.220 --> 00:09:40.180
The search for the Ide has
gotten really troublesome.

00:09:43.970 --> 00:09:45.930
I wonder what that blast was...

00:09:45.930 --> 00:09:47.810
They're probably clearing the jungle.

00:09:48.190 --> 00:09:50.440
I saw an unfamiliar plane flying around too.

00:09:50.440 --> 00:09:52.400
That's the third colony ship.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:53.980
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:09:53.980 --> 00:09:54.690
Nah, it's fine.

00:09:55.030 --> 00:09:57.280
Lou... that's hot, so don't touch it.

00:10:01.410 --> 00:10:03.370
This one is yours, Lou. See?

00:10:04.740 --> 00:10:06.830
Mama!

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:06.830
Lou!

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:09.040
It's lunchtime! Come and get it!

00:10:09.040 --> 00:10:10.670
It's time to eat!

00:10:11.580 --> 00:10:13.290
Piper Lou, what's wrong?

00:10:13.290 --> 00:10:15.300
You don't seem well.

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:16.590
He hasn't been like this before.

00:10:17.010 --> 00:10:18.510
Mama.

00:10:19.380 --> 00:10:21.430
Okay, let's eat together.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:25.600
Mama!

00:10:25.600 --> 00:10:28.230
What's wrong, Lou? Calm down, calm down.

00:10:29.350 --> 00:10:31.230
You've got food all over your face.

00:10:31.230 --> 00:10:32.980
Your father is coming here too, right?

00:10:32.980 --> 00:10:33.570
Yes.

00:10:39.360 --> 00:10:40.950
I wonder what that siren's for...

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:49.120
Radar disturbance detected!

00:10:49.120 --> 00:10:50.710
Cavian, stay on alert!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.040
Southern Cross, help the colonists evacuate!

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:54.590
The colonists are heading for shelter.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:57.170
What is this radar disturbance about?

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.510
We shouldn't panic until we know for certain.

00:11:01.260 --> 00:11:02.800
Is this another military exercise?

00:11:03.180 --> 00:11:06.760
In any case, there's only
 five thousand people on Solo.

00:11:07.270 --> 00:11:09.140
There's no reason to assume it's an enemy.

00:11:12.440 --> 00:11:14.150
Split up into three groups and attack.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:17.440
Destroy all buildings and
 weapons that get in your sight.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:19.780
Then drop the Gadakka teams.

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.330
They're constructing a colony?

00:11:34.040 --> 00:11:35.750
Will homing missiles work on them?

00:11:47.310 --> 00:11:48.350
Not too bad!

00:12:13.210 --> 00:12:14.620
New Lopia has been attacked?!

00:12:35.060 --> 00:12:35.810
What about you, ma'am?

00:12:36.190 --> 00:12:37.980
I'm going see what's happening in New Lopia.

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.860
Lotta! Take shelter in the forest.

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:41.360
Okay.

00:12:42.030 --> 00:12:45.240
Don't worry, I'll find out what's
happening with your parents.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.200
Thanks!

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:54.790
Why are there so many holes
in this machine anyway?

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:56.920
This was built by the Sixth Civilization.

00:12:56.920 --> 00:12:59.290
They probably just forgot to load weapons on them.

00:12:59.630 --> 00:13:00.210
Anyway...

00:13:00.920 --> 00:13:02.670
Did you finish adjusting the control panel?

00:13:03.760 --> 00:13:06.630
I'm finishing it now. The others are
connecting the Glen Cannons.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.300
New Lopia is under an air raid!

00:13:10.600 --> 00:13:12.600
Get that robot working fast!

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:12.600
Air raid?

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:13.350
Yeah!

00:13:13.350 --> 00:13:16.600
The New Lopian residents are taking refuge
in the jungle, everyone's in panic!

00:13:17.150 --> 00:13:18.020
I see.

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:21.570
I think we should take shelter at
the second excavation site.

00:13:21.940 --> 00:13:22.860
Lead me there!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:23.360
Eh?

00:13:23.690 --> 00:13:24.320
Okay...

00:13:26.860 --> 00:13:27.740
Joliver!

00:13:27.740 --> 00:13:28.990
How's the maintenance going there?

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:31.200
We should be able to transform
it using just the backup system.

00:13:31.530 --> 00:13:34.120
All the wires ought to be connected.

00:13:34.120 --> 00:13:36.000
So why isn't the gauge lighting up?

00:13:37.540 --> 00:13:39.880
She said it was called the Ideon Gauge, right?

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:41.040
Yeah.

00:13:41.040 --> 00:13:42.840
But can you make sense out of this wiring?

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:43.630
Lotta!

00:13:43.960 --> 00:13:44.920
Over here, over here!

00:13:45.340 --> 00:13:47.430
Deck! Is it okay to ride that thing?

00:13:47.430 --> 00:13:48.720
It's not the army's...

00:13:52.010 --> 00:13:53.390
This thing seems pretty sturdy!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:54.560
Get on, Lotta!

00:13:55.770 --> 00:13:56.980
Okay, we'll do that.

00:13:57.350 --> 00:13:58.690
Everyone, get on it!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:10.110
Calm down, Lou.

00:14:10.110 --> 00:14:10.660
Lin!

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:11.620
Yeah!

00:14:21.670 --> 00:14:22.750
The gauge lit up.

00:14:22.750 --> 00:14:23.590
We can go!

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:24.300
Can you do it?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:25.840
I got it to move earlier.

00:14:26.460 --> 00:14:28.130
Lotta, make him stop crying!

00:14:28.130 --> 00:14:29.760
I'm sorry, but...

00:14:29.760 --> 00:14:32.300
I'm trying my best to concentrate on the controls!

00:14:32.800 --> 00:14:33.720
Sit tight!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:34.760
It's dangerous.

00:14:35.680 --> 00:14:36.220
It turned on!

00:14:37.020 --> 00:14:38.060
All right! Let's go!

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:39.480
Shut up!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:40.900
Don't yell like that.

00:14:40.900 --> 00:14:42.190
It's only going to make things worse.

00:14:42.190 --> 00:14:43.400
I've got some candy.

00:14:43.400 --> 00:14:44.230
Thanks.

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:45.440
Here, Lou.

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:02.880
We've discovered the Copola remains.

00:15:02.880 --> 00:15:04.090
I'll shoot a flare.

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:12.180
Drop the Gadakkas near that light!

00:15:12.180 --> 00:15:13.640
Find Lady Karala as fast as possible!

00:15:22.900 --> 00:15:24.310
I did it, Mom!

00:15:30.360 --> 00:15:31.320
Lady Karala!

00:15:34.530 --> 00:15:37.410
Once we get out of this forest, there's
a place where we can take shelter.

00:15:37.620 --> 00:15:39.120
Please have a little bit more patience.

00:15:39.120 --> 00:15:40.620
Those are the aliens...

00:15:41.460 --> 00:15:42.540
They aren't military?

00:15:42.540 --> 00:15:43.920
My mommy...

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:45.710
She'll be following us soon.

00:15:46.750 --> 00:15:47.420
It's the enemy!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.920
Those are aliens?

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:53.800
They look just like us.

00:15:53.800 --> 00:15:54.840
Oh crap...

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:57.010
What if Lady Karala gets mixed up in that crowd?

00:16:01.100 --> 00:16:04.850
Just as Damido said, the aliens
are as advanced as we are.

00:16:08.190 --> 00:16:09.360
Are the weapons loaded?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:10.190
I'm gonna move this thing!

00:16:10.570 --> 00:16:11.190
Yeah!

00:16:11.190 --> 00:16:12.900
We've put on the last missiles.

00:16:12.900 --> 00:16:14.320
Is it okay to transform now?

00:16:14.320 --> 00:16:15.870
That's why we've got space left.

00:16:15.870 --> 00:16:17.580
I trust that it'll be fine.

00:16:17.580 --> 00:16:18.280
Roger!

00:16:18.780 --> 00:16:19.620
Launching!

00:16:25.000 --> 00:16:25.580
Hey.

00:16:25.580 --> 00:16:27.460
Did you really operate this earlier?

00:16:27.460 --> 00:16:28.460
No mistake about it.

00:16:28.460 --> 00:16:29.340
Just watch!

00:16:36.050 --> 00:16:37.010
It moved!

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:38.800
Don't make him cry!

00:16:38.800 --> 00:16:41.520
If I can't focus on this, we're all gonna die!

00:16:41.970 --> 00:16:43.100
Cosmo...

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:44.020
There, there.

00:16:44.810 --> 00:16:45.900
Lady Karala!

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.820
You managed to get here all by yourself?

00:16:58.820 --> 00:16:59.330
Get on.

00:17:02.910 --> 00:17:04.120
Hurry up and go.

00:17:07.290 --> 00:17:09.210
A new group of enemies has arrived.

00:17:09.210 --> 00:17:12.170
All units, concentrate your attack on
the three machines in front.

00:17:13.090 --> 00:17:15.420
However, they don't look like fighter jets...

00:17:18.840 --> 00:17:19.430
They're coming.

00:17:19.430 --> 00:17:20.470
Fire the missiles!

00:17:20.470 --> 00:17:21.950
During that time, we'll form Ideon.

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.810
But doing that while docking...

00:17:24.730 --> 00:17:27.770
Are you telling me to fight an air
battle in our present condition?!

00:17:34.570 --> 00:17:36.650
It's got the power of a heavy bomber?!

00:17:41.530 --> 00:17:43.540
A Dekka Bau's gun has no effect?

00:17:43.540 --> 00:17:44.250
How can that be?

00:17:46.710 --> 00:17:48.540
Fire the missiles!

00:17:47.870 --> 00:17:48.540
I am!

00:17:56.010 --> 00:17:57.170
One down!

00:17:57.170 --> 00:17:58.630
We're going to win at this rate.

00:17:58.630 --> 00:18:00.680
Those were clearly direct hits!

00:18:00.680 --> 00:18:02.100
Why aren't they going down?!

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.140
We shot one down.

00:18:09.900 --> 00:18:12.610
Even a Gata Type missile isn't enough?!

00:18:13.770 --> 00:18:14.860
Must not have been a direct hit...

00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:16.900
Shut him up!

00:18:16.900 --> 00:18:18.530
Cosmo, don't say that.

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.760
It's just normal to be afraid in a situation like this.

00:18:23.910 --> 00:18:24.790
Again?

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:27.200
We should now be able to dock and turn into Ideon.

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.660
Docking?

00:18:28.660 --> 00:18:29.460
Look!

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:31.130
The other two are docking!

00:18:31.130 --> 00:18:32.630
All guns, cover them!

00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:39.300
Hey, I can't see a thing anymore!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:42.760
Let's go too.

00:18:47.810 --> 00:18:49.230
Have we docked?

00:18:49.230 --> 00:18:51.020
The front monitor hasn't changed.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:53.810
I don't really understand it,
but this machine is amazing!

00:19:02.030 --> 00:19:03.200
It became a giant!

00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:06.040
Those machines combined into a giant in mid-air?!

00:19:06.540 --> 00:19:08.160
Damned aliens.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:09.830
Are you trying to intimidate us?

00:19:11.710 --> 00:19:12.460
They're coming!

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:14.590
Fire! Missile bay, what are you doing?!

00:19:20.380 --> 00:19:21.930
That had to be a direct hit.

00:19:22.590 --> 00:19:23.300
What?!

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.220
It's undamaged.

00:19:28.220 --> 00:19:29.890
That monster's undamaged?!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:33.020
Let's ascend! Ideon, rise up!

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:35.270
Don't make Lou cry!

00:19:39.820 --> 00:19:41.450
The main power is rising?

00:19:42.030 --> 00:19:43.160
Your name was Kasha, right?

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.490
Is the power in the legs rising?

00:19:44.490 --> 00:19:45.490
It's rising.

00:19:45.490 --> 00:19:46.660
I'll leave the controls to you.

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:47.080
All right!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.240
Cosmo, let's go!

00:19:49.830 --> 00:19:50.910
Let's go!

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:55.290
They're coming!

00:19:54.330 --> 00:19:55.290
Get out of there!

00:19:55.290 --> 00:19:56.750
They're targeting you!

00:19:58.670 --> 00:19:59.460
Bastard!

00:20:01.470 --> 00:20:02.380
Cupa...

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:07.640
How can this be happening?

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:11.020
To come across an alien giant while
searching for the Ide on Logo Dau...

00:20:13.520 --> 00:20:14.230
It couldn't be...

00:20:14.230 --> 00:20:15.600
The Giant of Ide?!

00:20:16.560 --> 00:20:17.310
No, that's wrong.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:21.780
The Legendary Giant of Ide can't be
some kind of mechanical construct!

00:20:22.360 --> 00:20:24.240
All units, follow me!

00:20:27.870 --> 00:20:29.790
Kasha, can't you boost the power?

00:20:30.200 --> 00:20:30.790
They're escaping.

00:20:30.790 --> 00:20:32.080
Can't you fire the missiles?

00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:33.210
What's wrong?

00:20:33.580 --> 00:20:34.460
We can't.

00:20:34.460 --> 00:20:36.330
It seems the missiles were installed
in the wrong places.

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:38.210
We can't fire them once we've docked.

00:20:38.790 --> 00:20:41.260
Look at the Ideon Gauge! It looks
like the power's falling.

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:41.590
What?

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:49.760
They've escaped...

00:20:50.560 --> 00:20:52.430
Just when we were about to finish them off...

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.480
It's because Piper Lou was disturbing me!

00:20:57.310 --> 00:20:59.610
Stop it, Lou, you're tickling me.

00:20:59.610 --> 00:21:00.730
Huh?

00:21:00.730 --> 00:21:02.110
His mood's gotten better already?

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:09.260
We're falling!

00:21:09.780 --> 00:21:10.910
We'll get through this somehow.

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:31.780
Everybody's taken shelter at
the second excavation site.

00:21:39.610 --> 00:21:41.860
I wonder if they finished off the enemies.

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.540
No, it seems they got away.

00:21:44.240 --> 00:21:45.110
I see.

00:21:49.370 --> 00:21:50.820
It's separating again.

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:54.900
That means...

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.480
It's possible that the machine buried
here at the second excavation site...

00:22:00.460 --> 00:22:04.420
could be related to this "Ideon" robot.

00:22:05.550 --> 00:22:06.670
Yes, it has to be so!

00:22:09.890 --> 00:22:11.260
Is the air raid over?

00:22:20.440 --> 00:22:23.150
The size of this deck...

00:22:24.020 --> 00:22:27.300
I wonder if it's big enough to carry that robot...

00:22:51.930 --> 00:22:54.350
<i>In order to rescue Karala, who
has infiltrated the Earthlings,</i>

00:22:54.350 --> 00:22:56.560
<i>the Buff Clan assault team draws near.</i>

00:22:57.270 --> 00:23:02.610
<i>In the middle of the furious battle,
Cosmo causes Gije to gasp in awe.</i>

00:23:03.310 --> 00:23:08.320
<i>Carrying the evacuees, the second
relic soared up from underground.</i>

00:23:09.070 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>Next time on Legendary Giant God
Ideon: "The Trembling Earth."</i>

00:23:12.780 --> 00:23:17.240
<b>The Trembling Earth</b>

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:35.260
tatta hitotsu no hoshi ni suterare

00:23:30.380 --> 00:23:35.260
<i>I've been abandoned merely by one world</i>

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:42.600
owarinai tabi kimi to ayumu to

00:23:36.560 --> 00:23:42.600
<i>As I walk this endless journey together with you</i>

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:48.150
itsukushimi futo wakeatte

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:48.150
<i>We unexpectedly share our affection</i>

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:55.530
kizu wo nameau douke shibai

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:55.530
<i>Feeling sympathy for each other in this farcical play</i>

00:23:55.870 --> 00:24:01.620
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:23:55.870 --> 00:24:01.620
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:08.210
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:08.210
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:14.180
kosumosu sora wo kakenukete

00:24:08.550 --> 00:24:14.180
<i>Traveling through the skies of cosmos</i>

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:21.560
inori wo ima kimi no moto e

00:24:14.890 --> 00:24:21.560
<i>I'll send a prayer your way</i>

